```</p><p><h3>Test Results Interpretation</h3>
<ul><li><strong>80%+ Pass Rate</strong>: Systems fully operational</li>
<li><strong>50-79% Pass Rate</strong>: Partial functionality, review warnings</li>
<li><strong>&lt;50% Pass Rate</strong>: Critical issues, check build configuration</li></ul></p><p><h3>Manual Testing Commands</h3>
```bash
<h1>Test memory safety</h1>
