```</p><p><h2>🔧 Integration &amp; Usage</h2></p><p><h3>Engine Integration</h3>
Hardening systems are automatically integrated into the engine:
<ul><li><strong>Com_Init()</strong>: Initializes all hardening frameworks</li>
<li><strong>Com_Frame()</strong>: Updates monitoring systems</li>
<li><strong>Com_Shutdown()</strong>: Generates final reports</li></ul></p><p><h3>Memory Management</h3>
```c
